# ==============================================================================
# ShopSphere Production DevSecOps Security Exception Registry
#
# Policy & Governance Requirements:
# 1. Zero tolerance for unpatched CVEs where fixed releases exist.
# 2. Every retained entry must document:
#    - CVE Identifier
#    - Classification: [NOT AFFECTED] | [MITIGATED] | [STILL VULNERABLE]
#    - Upstream Affected Component & Fixed Version
#    - Technical Architecture & Attack Preconditions
#    - Compensating Mitigation Controls
#    - Security Owner
#    - Review & Expiry Date
# 3. An exception is NEVER claimed as "fixed" merely because it is ignored.
# ==============================================================================

